  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p>Whenever you try to convince a non-spellcaster that a magical phenomenon or creature is not magical, you treat the lie as two steps more believable. In addition, non-spellcasters are always treated as wanting to believe you when you try to convince them that something is not magic.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
